keywords:
  - facility location
  - p-center
  - minimax
  - partial identification
  - robust optimization
  - organ transport
  - air medical transport
  - operational research
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Code, input data, and scripts reproducing every figure and every number in
  the manuscript. The work locates three short takeoff and landing aircraft
  bases for time-critical organ transport in Poland, using a minimax criterion
  over admissible source-centre pairs, because no central record of
  donor-recipient pairs is kept. All four location models are solved by
  exhaustive enumeration of the 5456 airfield triples, so the optima are exact.
